      "body": "Fixes #7353.\n\nThe /item session-record first row (label + source badge + agent badge) had no containment of its own: .badge is inline-block with white-space: nowrap, so a long unbroken agentLabel (136-char token fixture from the #3949 stress measurement) rendered 821px wide at a 390px viewport. The #3949 fix contained .session-record-meta but not the badge row.\n\nChange (mobile media query only, mirroring the .attention-card-header badge precedent): session-record-line badges get box-sizing: border-box, max-width: 100%, white-space: normal, overflow-wrap: anywhere. src/assets/app.css rebuilt with bun run build:css. Normal short labels render unchanged (rule is inside the max-width: 480px query and only relaxes wrapping).\n\nTests (oracle: the new source assertions in test/mobile-targets.test.ts):\n- With fix: bun test test/mobile-targets.test.ts - 10 pass.\n- Pre-fix ui.css with the new assertions: 1 fail (reproduces the missing containment).\n- Full aggregator suite: 1808 pass / 19 fail with fix vs 1809 pass / 18 fail on clean main; the named failing tests are identical in both runs (pre-existing: projects parsing, inFlightBoardItems, pool assembly, renderProgramProject, source-gate boot) and the count delta is unnamed 5s timeout flakes. No new failures.\n\nQueue task 14203, lane code-o.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796796363&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7985&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7985&signature=92bb4e11030cdd9ed44653fb61ec24b2db22224616e1458d1ada74d2ea8b41f3\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7985?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
